node: Versions/Current -> A: allowed
node: binary -> Versions/Current/...: allowed
node: async Resources -> Versions/Current/Resources: allowed
node: dangling Libraries -> Versions/Current/Libraries: allowed
node: read through the links: binary
node: target outside (absolute): denied
node: target outside (relative): denied
node: link outside the package: denied
node: target through a link, then ..: denied
node: program outside (node_gyp_bins/python3 -> /bin/sh): allowed
node: plain file outside (/etc/hosts): denied
deno run -A: Deno.symlinkSync in own dir: allowed
deno run -A: Deno.symlink in own dir: allowed
deno run -A: Deno.symlinkSync to /: denied (NotCapable)
